.presets.name","settings":{"layout":"full_bleed","slide_height":"large","slider_visual":"dots","auto_rotate":true,"change_slides_speed":3,"image_behavior":"none","show_text_below":true,"accessibility_info":"Slideshow about our brand"}},"image_with_text_WMkTgg":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_TrAi7Y":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"The Story of Indian Rug Store – A Four Decades Legacy Woven in Jaipur","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_zAKDCq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Around 40 years ago, in the heart of Jaipur — famously known as the Pink City and the land of majestic palaces — the journey of Indian Rug Store began as a small family-owned rug store built on craftsmanship, tradition, and trust.<\/p><p>Tourists visiting Jaipur used to visit our store and buy handmade rugs inspired by the rich craftsmanship of Rajasthan. Once they returned home, many customers contacted us again to place custom rug orders for their homes, hotels, and projects. They also recommended our rugs to their friends and families, helping our name spread through trust and word of mouth. Over the years, this support grew into a loyal customer base across the world, especially in the United States, where our handmade rugs became highly appreciated for their quality and authenticity.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_TrAi7Y","text_zAKDCq"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image.png_202608151832.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":76,"padding_bottom":48}},"rich_text_xNXaWg":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"text_pDTKci":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>With an increasing number of customers from around the globe wanting access to authentic handmade rugs, we realized it was time to bring our store online. This vision led to the creation of IndianRugStore.com — an e-commerce destination where anyone, anywhere in the world, could explore and purchase genuine handmade rugs directly from the makers.<br\/><br\/>Today, while we have embraced modern e-commerce, our roots remain the same. Every rug still reflects the heritage of Indian craftsmanship, the artistry of our skilled weavers, and the tradition that started decades ago in the beautiful city of Jaipur.<br\/><br\/>The response to our online journey has been incredible, and we are proud to continue sharing authentic handmade rugs with homes across the world — carrying forward a legacy built on trust, quality, and timeless craftsmanship.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_pDTKci"],"custom_css":["@media screen and (max-width: 749px) {.rich-text__blocks {margin-top: -100px !important; \/* adjust value *\/ }}"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"left","heading_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":false,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"collection_list_M7L4Yg":{"type":"collection-list","blocks":{"featured_collection_dUKWjC":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"tufted-rugs"}},"featured_collection_hnazWR":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"handmade-oushak-rugs"}},"featured_collection_g7TyQz":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"contemporary-rugs"}},"featured_collection_VYbiGi":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"bohemian"}},"featured_collection_3769TU":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"wool-jute-kilims"}},"featured_collection_HfKYbf":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"oriental-rugs"}},"featured_collection_d3wBQP":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"jute-flat-weave"}},"featured_collection_yWayCb":{"type":"featured_collection","settings":{"collection":"solid-striped-rugs"}},"featured